    "description": "CUMBU is the Class B USD digital share of the ChinaAMC USD Digital Money Market Fund, a Hong Kong-domiciled money market fund focused on liquidity management through short-term deposits and high-quality money market instruments. The Class B share class is an unlisted digital format intended to simplify access and operations for eligible investors while retaining the underlying exposure in a regulated fund vehicle. Class B carries a 0.40% per annum management fee and is designed with a very low minimum subscription amount, supporting small ticket allocations alongside institutional use cases.",
